<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Lottery cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Int'l Lottery cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane said it downgraded International Lottery Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-1/8, or 14.3 percent, to 6-3/4 in early afternoon trade.</p>
<p>-- lowered earnings estimates of instant lottery machine maker to $0.40 per share from $0.75 for 1996, and to $0.77 from $1.05 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- said rating and estimates cut &quot;to reflect delays in receipt of orders for certain dispensing machines.&quot;</p>
</text>
